block content


    section.source_section
        h2 List variations

        h3 Numbered list
        .source_example
            .ux3
                .container
                    ol
                        li The formin FMN2 generates a perinuclear actin/adhesion system
                        li FMN2 regulates nuclear position during 2D migration
                        li FMN2 protects against DNA damage and cell death during invasive 3D migration
                        li FMN2 promotes metastasis of melanoma cells to the lung


        h3 Bullets list
        markdown
            p In the example below we've used the default styles.
        .source_example
            .ux3
                .container
                    ul
                        li The formin FMN2 generates a perinuclear actin/adhesion system
                        li FMN2 regulates nuclear position during 2D migration
                        li FMN2 protects against DNA damage and cell death during invasive 3D migration
                        li FMN2 promotes metastasis of melanoma cells to the lung
        h3 Download list
        markdown
            p In the example below we've used `download-links` class to add a borders above and below the list
        .source_example
            .ux3
                .container
                    ul.rlist--inline.separator.download-links
                        li
                            a(href="#") Figure Viewer
                        li
                            a(href="#") View Hi-Res Image
                        li.hidden-xs
                            a(href="#") Download (PPT)

    | #{''}